/target
**/target

# The fuzzing corpus is not in the repository. It is thousands of tiny files that change every time
# anything runs, and CI already carries it between runs in a cache, which is where a corpus that
# grows on its own belongs. Crashes are uploaded as artifacts, and one worth keeping becomes a case
# in the guard's corpus module instead.
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
/fuzz/coverage
/fuzz/Cargo.lock
*.profraw
lcov.info
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
